30">on </span><span begin="00:08.730" end="00:08.850">the </span><span begin="00:08.850" end="00:10.350">wall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.730" end="00:26.430"><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:24.660">Today </span><span begin="00:24.660" end="00:24.960">was </span><span begin="00:24.960" end="00:26.430">misery</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.850" end="00:30.150"><span begin="00:26.850" end="00:27.330">and </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.570">I </span><span begin="00:27.570" end="00:27.930">just </span><span begin="00:27.930" end="00:28.320">can't </span><span begin="00:28.320" end="00:28.920">believe </span><span begin="00:28.920" end="00:29.280">this </span><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:30.150">happened</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.300" end="00:33.690"><span begin="00:30.300" end="00:30.570">and </span><span begin="00:30.570" end="00:30.630">I </span><span begin="00:30.630" end="00:31.710">finally </span><span begin="00:31.710" end="00:32.100">broke </span><span begin="00:32.100" end="00:33.690">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.690" end="00:35.340"><span begin="00:33.690" end="00:33.925">（</span><span begin="00:33.925" end="00:34.160">and </span><span begin="00:34.160" end="00:34.395">I </span><span begin="00:34.395" end="00:34.630">finally </span><span begin="00:34.630" end="00:34.865">broke </span><span begin="00:34.865" end="00:35.100">down</span><span begin="00:35.100" end="00:35.340">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.340" end="00:38.070"><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.910">She </span><span begin="00:35.910" end="00:36.390">held </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.870">onto </span><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.170">my </span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:38.070">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.370" end="00:41.790"><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.790">but </span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:39.180">now </span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.540">my </span><